      "updated": 1789366488057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Application audit_events (Postgres)\n\n• action — e.g. create, grant\n• result — success, denied\n• metadata — free-form context\n• created_at — when it happened\n\n→ Answers: which user did what,\n   and did it succeed?",
