      "updated": 1789366488057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "OpenFGA's own changelog table\n\n• store_id — which OpenFGA store\n• user, relation, object — the tuple\n• operation — insert (grant) vs\n  delete (revoke)\n• high-precision timestamp\n\n→ Answers: when was this exact\n   permission granted or revoked?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el00057964",
      "originalText": "OpenFGA's own changelog table\n\n• store_id — which OpenFGA store\n• user, relation, object — the tuple\n• operation — insert (grant) vs\n  delete (revoke)\n• high-precision timestamp\n\n→ Answers: when was this exact\n   permission granted or revoked?",
